  "Name": "Kinect Adventures!",
  "Overview": "Kinect Adventures! uses the Kinect camera to turn jumps, steps, and arm movements into the controls for five activities. Players steer a raft in River Rush, dodge obstacles on a moving platform in Reflex Ridge, and return balls in Rallyball. Space Pop involves bursting bubbles in low gravity, while 20,000 Leaks has players plug holes in an underwater observation chamber. Players can complete adventure challenges and earn medals alone or play the activities together.",
